cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "DE-LIMP and the UC Davis Proteomics Core pipeline (Claude Code skill)"
abstract: "DE-LIMP is an R/Shiny application and Claude Code skill (ucdavis-proteomics-core-pipeline) for reproducible DIA proteomics: database search with DIA-NN or Sage, limpa DPC-Quant and limma differential expression, quality audits, publication Methods, AI-written reports with independent review, and a full reproducibility bundle for every run."
authors:
